Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.22,0:00:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're listening to Mariah Radio,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we've got another rousing\Nsegment for your aural pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help, Midnight Mentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our first letter is coming to\Nyou from Forever 21, Pretty Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kai, get a load of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, I was late to my little\Nrendezvous because of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one by the station!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crossing that never\Nopens when you need it to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me how you really feel, pretty baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
