Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess we aren't the only stand\Nusers at this school after all, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.77,0:02:08.10,Title Part 4 Episode 2,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(654,640)\pos(1794,880)\fs60}Episode 7: {\fs80} Hazamada Toshikazu (Surface)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toshikazu Hazamada enrolled\Nas a junior in Group C.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he and his buddy had a\Nfalling out over something
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trivial right before\Nthe spring term started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems the friend dissed Hazemada's\Nfavorite idol or anime or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.76,0:02:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, that'd be nothing\Nto write home about,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but everything changed one\Nnight when the friend he was
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,arguing with gouged out his own\Neye with a mechanical pencil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.66,0:02:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear Hazemada's friend\Nsaid this in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I came to, I was staring at my eyeball\Nin my hand with the only eye I had left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying this guy\Nripped out his friend's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eye and he used some kind\Nof stand to do the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that could be what happened here,\Nbut there's no surefire way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:03:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, the average person\Nisn't able to see a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This all sounds fishy to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chosuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you think you are, but\Nyou've got no right to say that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a real job now, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, you're actually working now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to land myself a sweet\Nlittle gig in finance. Finance, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure that isn't code\Nfor Lone Shark or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, let's just say I'm\Nworking with some good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, but did\Nyou forget about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.22,0:03:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're seriously gonna go too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.64,0:03:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let that jackass Josuke handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something evil's taking over our town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if Morioh's in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dad, sis, and pretty much everyone else\NI care about are in danger as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, but it has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:03:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a gutsy thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, I would expect\Nnothing less from my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys will have to excuse\Nme as I've got to get home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of trouble, Master Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like he's\Nhiding out in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it'd be kind of\Ncreepy if he was in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him coming back to school and\Nacting like nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially after digging out\Nhis friend's eye with a pencil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys like that are psychos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just taking a quick look\Nthrough this guy's locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye out, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least you could do is give\Nme some warning next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, he left his bag,\Nso he did come back to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's in the\Ntennis club and a manga fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he'd be right at\Nhome in a hoarder's club.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see how he could have hidden that\Nbow and arrow in here with all this shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell is this wooden thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's just an ordinary object.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would this freak have one of those\Nwooden mannequins they sell in art stores?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That scared the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I touched it, and the\Nthing turned into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that pretty much proves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hazemata's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turning into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the cheeky move, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The manga, Perman. You know it?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.80,0:06:21.44,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: A manga and animated TV series about a clumsy boy who becomes a superhero's apprentice. {Retime this as you see fit. I just wanted to include this since Perman wouldn't be remotely familiar to an English viewer}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.80,0:06:21.44,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: A Japanese comic and animated TV series about a clumsy boy who becomes a superhero's apprentice. {Retime this as you see fit. I just wanted to include this since Perman wouldn't be remotely familiar to an English viewer}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it sounds just like you, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you read Perman, you'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a copy robot in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's handy, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you wish that you had\None right about now. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.18,0:06:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi, what's\Nthis guy mumbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this Perman guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me you haven't read Perman?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be asking the questions around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got my arm! Yusuke, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I must give you a fair warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My robot is one that you\Nwon't want to have around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once it copies you, you'll be making\Nall the same movements it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means, it's really not a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:07:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually a puppet master!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, watch out!
