Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.30,0:07:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keicho.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like that, another\None bites the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best part, I didn't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The honor of knocking him into Kingdom\NCome goes to you, his dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's underhanded shit like that\Nthat really gets my blood boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.66,0:07:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making others do your dirty\Nwork because you don't have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the balls to come out and\Ntake care of things yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing makes me want to\Nkick someone's ass more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems as though I'm outside\Nof your range and if you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't get any closer to me\Nthen neither can your stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words Josuke as\Nlong as I make sure to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always keep a little distance\Nbetween the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have a snowball's\Nchance in hell of defeating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know my stand's name is show-off and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,possessing this doll has\Ngiven my stand physical form.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result it can now be\Nseen by any ordinary person!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you Hazamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My objective is simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulverize Jotaro to\Nwithin an inch of his life
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and make sure he never\Nreturns to this town!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a pathetic outsider snooping\Naround and getting in our business?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a little birdie told me that Jotaro's Star
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Platinum can stop time\Nfor a couple of seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a single stand user among\Nus who can get anywhere close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, the one stand that can do the\Njob is the one that just copied you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:09:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you out of the game, but I'll\Nbe sure to give Jotaro your regards!
