Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sound of painful\Nsquishing, it's so sublime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as long as you didn't sever the nerve,\Nyou might have a chance at seeing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is if luck decides to smile on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given his injury, I think\Nhe'll be out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, pick up my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to start our hunt for Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made it too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if I'm not mistaken,\NJotaro's hotel is...
