Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Mariah Grand Hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi! Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm doing okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:10:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're tougher than\Nanyone gives you credit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.50,0:10:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you're all busted up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you still managed to tag that\Nimposter with your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
