Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment you sent me flying,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you healed my broken bones\Nwith Shining Diamond's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uh, do you think you could heal the\Ninjuries I got when I slammed into the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a bother,\Nbut I'm in a lot of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've reached the Mariah\Ngrand hotel yeah hi how's it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:11:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going i need jotaro kujo He\Nshould be staying in room 324.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.26,0:11:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to tell Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro about that stand\Nbefore it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the line\Nfor room 324 is busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can try calling again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be talking to the copy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.90,0:11:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got to him first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you found proof that there's\Nanother stand user at your school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fill you in at Mariah Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's meet at the square in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can get there in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you in front of the station in 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy as pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit! No answer. This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have left, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means they probably baited\NJotaro to go and meet them somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we can do now is go after the copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell you two\Napart to save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stealing my face is weird enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what really freaks\Nme out are his fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How often do you catch a glimpse of\Nyour fingers compared to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize that standard copied\Nme down to the finger press.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're back early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Master Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hazamada, what the heck\Nare you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tamami Kobayashi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea why we're hanging out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, give it a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all guessed out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you don't even have one little theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I have one, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry and catch up\Nwith Hazamada, Jotaro is done for!
