Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let Jotaro meet up with the\Ncopier, it'll be a total disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I haven't figured out a solution\Nyet, so for now, all we can do is run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll catch you later, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow. Yeah, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you yet, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are these chattering\Nschoolgirls only saying goodbye to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one ever says stuff like that to\Nme when I leave school for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I care since every\Ngirl in this school is butt-ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, could you read this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, bye then!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you accepting notes from\Nher, like it would do you any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell makes a jerk\Nlike you so special anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.36,0:14:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The show's over now,\Nso let's just move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you've forgotten, but we\Ndon't have time to dilly-dally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak to me that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Punching a guy made of wood\Nwas bound to end badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was pretty stupid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up and cry crowding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really starting to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This always happens with my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like when I copied my\Ncrush Junko the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She morphed into a complete bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't take it, so the\Nentire thing was a flop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there no one halfway decent\Non this miserable planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn Josuke'll get his.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first I have to take care of Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush him into paste.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.36,0:14:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:15:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding that\Nguy smudged my motorcycle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a douche damn that\Ndumbass and his dirty fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy man It was\Nprobably an accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know besides What do you think\NI care if that asshole hears me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.34,0:15:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at how he's\Nwalking damn It's like
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.70,0:15:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching a dying cricket\Non a death march Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a sick burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good one, dude! Yeah? You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was pretty funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it! Show off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold him still while I settle the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing, you freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, don't worry your pretty little\Nhead about what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just focus on relaxing and I'll make\Nsure you never open that mouth again
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glass shard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the shrimp's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hazamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally caught up to you and Pinocchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How soon we forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come face to face with my\Nshow-off if you dare, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.24,0:16:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment you do, you'll\Ninstantly be turned into a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now show off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it isn't obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That glass shard I chucked your\Nway wasn't meant to take you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I threw it so that it would\Nreform into its original shape.
