Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sliced off my right hand,\Nand it turned back into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good, Hazamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.56,0:16:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just pretend you're resting\Nyour hand in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More importantly, that bastard Jotaro\Nshould arrive at the station any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I'd like to get rid of Josuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't have time to\Nwaste tracking him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asamata!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're meeting in\Nfront of the station, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.36,0:17:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two already have a head start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the fact\Nthat the road they just
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,took is the fastest way\Nto get to the station!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've got a secret weapon\Nin tow, Koichi. You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he's not here yet i guess he\Nran into some trouble what's the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,word you see josuke anywhere nope\Nnowhere to be found there's nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to worry about though if i so much\Nas glance at him he'll be turned
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into my puppet in a flash huh hear\Nthat Hazamada a train's coming
