Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he catches up to us, the\Ntrain will stop him! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one minute left,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.62,0:18:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all sights point to us making\Nit to the meeting spot first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Joesta and that brat Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's the crossing open?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will someone explain\Nwhat the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hazamada! Over there! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that stand?
