Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.26,0:18:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make the perfect secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the assist back there, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Josuke! Huh? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, we got Hazamada\Ngood, didn't we, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand that copied your likeness\Ndown to the fingerprints?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.16,0:19:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he'd gotten to you before me and\NKoichi, who knows what would have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least, now we can relax a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I severed its right hand, so it\Nought to be easy to tell us apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to think on my feet, but\Nfigured that would be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we play the waiting game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We weren't that far ahead, so\Nthey should show up pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I take a pen\Nout of Jotaro's pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like my arm is frozen in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the other side of the\Nglass… Shit! It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jousuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.78,0:20:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, you're gonna plunge\Nthat pen into Jotaro's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blunt force trauma\Nshould kill him instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, leaving him alive\Nisn't really an option now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stand would only heal him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're meddling as the\Ncause of this, Jousuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only gonna beat\NJotaro up and chase him out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of town before you involved\Nyourself in my business!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now Jotaro's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it'll be by your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.58,0:20:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live with that, you uppity-asshat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send him to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.68,0:21:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though fortunately for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looks like those biker dudes\Nfinally tracked down Hazamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just where Josuke said\Nyou'd be a piece of bug shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.34,0:21:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding out at the station\Nlike the coward you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Josuke Fool is swell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went out of his way\Nto treat our wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if I don't totally\Nunderstand how we fixed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time we paid you back\Nfor the stunt you pulled!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's somethin' out behind the\Nbathroom and we're dyin' to show ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lie, that stand can\Nbe pretty scary if it copies you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, time to send it to\Nthe big workshop in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll feel a lot better\Nonce it's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Tamami was\Nadmitted to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.88,0:22:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a self-destructive fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.32,0:22:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my condolences!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.89,0:22:53.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.26,0:22:55.52,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.52,0:22:58.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.31,0:22:59.98,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.98,0:23:02.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pain, it is old, I'm tired.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.36,0:23:04.73,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again,\NI'ma move so slightly!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.73,0:23:07.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.92,0:23:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the human kind of all\Nthat I need to, I want to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.53,0:23:09.24,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.14,0:23:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.24,0:23:11.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.49,0:23:13.83,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.62,0:23:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.83,0:23:15.45,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.45,0:23:18.08,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.06,0:23:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.08,0:23:22.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.58,0:23:26.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.98,0:23:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.13,0:23:31.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.68,0:23:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, ooh, I'm done by now.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.59,0:23:34.97,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
